stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued : seeded / inserted

    queued --> in_progress : claim (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    in_progress --> completed : worker succeeds
    in_progress --> queued : reclaim sweep (stalled, attempts < max_attempts)
    in_progress --> dead_letter_jobs : reclaim sweep (stalled, attempts = max_attempts)

    completed --> [*]
    dead_letter_jobs --> [*]
